abstract: >-
  Open-source Apache-2.0 deterministic flight-control, run-time assurance (RTA),
  and verification platform for a 240 kg coaxial X8 urban eVTOL (VertiRTA-X8-240)
  and 8+1 Lift+Cruise transition aircraft along the Istanbul Maltepe-Dragos-Kartal
  coastal corridor bounded by DHMI AIP LTFJ/LTBX control zones. Combines a
  freestanding zero-heap 400 Hz ARM Cortex-M7 C++17 flight core (28,886 B Flash,
  0 B static RAM, 2,960 B stack DAG), a 100 Hz GPU-solved 4D HJI-CBVF-QP safety
  filter, zero-GPL MAVLink v2 UDP offboard RTA shield, ESBMC v8.7.0 supplemental
  formal proofs (1,905/1,905 properties), Renode dual-FCC OpenCyphal CAN-FD SIL
  (12.50 ms failover), a 38.5 KiB WebAssembly VertiGCS console, a nanobind
  Python/Gymnasium SDK, 20-eVTOL U-Space + Part-IS security, and isolated
  bilingual Z3 Co-Pilot and zero-ShareAlike visual SLZ stacks.
